# Build-context hygiene for the static demo image (deploy/Dockerfile).
# The image only needs web/ plus the two pre-rendered display SVGs, so keep
# everything heavy or irrelevant out of the context: the build stays fast and
# the multi-GB GIS data can never leak into an image layer.

# Bulk GIS data + regenerable artifacts (datasets/ is 10s of GB, output/ has
# single files reaching ~1 GB). The two display SVGs the pages need are NOT
# baked in — they're bind-mounted read-only at runtime (see deploy/README.md),
# so nothing here needs to enter the build context.
datasets/
cache/
logs/
output/

# Python interpreter, caches, coverage.
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage*
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/

# Repo internals not needed by a static web image.
.git/
.github/
agent-os/
notebooks/
market-analysis/
experiments/
demo/
docs/
tests/
tools/
src/
assets/
*.ipynb

# OS / editor cruft.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
